    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000tdav](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000tdav) Magnitude 5.6 earthquake at 10.0 depth occurred on Sep 01 2026 74km E of Waleh. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude 0.1685 longitude 128.8054. It impacted 7070 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
